        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb four-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home to the market, ideally situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in the highly sought-after Woodvale Grove, Clonsilla, Dublin 15.\nWoodvale Grove is a peaceful and well-established residential location ideally positioned close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops and recreational facilities. The area is exceptionally well connected with easy access to the N3 and M50 motorway networks, making commuting throughout Dublin and beyond both convenient and straightforward.\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area with a W.C and the converted garage room with its own private bathroom to the ground floor. The converted garage provides a fantastic additional bedroom and offers excellent flexibility for modern family living, guest accommodation or those working from home. Upstairs hosts three well-appointed bedrooms together with a communal family bathroom.\nA standout feature of No. 5 is the converted garage, now providing an additional bedroom, offering excellent flexibility for modern family living. Externally, the property boasts an extra-large SOUTH-facing rear garden, providing a fantastic private outdoor space while remaining relatively low maintenance.\nNo. 5 comes to the market with a D2 BER rating and gas fired central heating. With generous accommodation, a superb garden, converted garage and an excellent location, this property offers huge potential and is ideally suited to growing families and those looking to upsize.\nGuide Price 419,000.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>Four bed / three bath semi-detached family home\n• D2 BER Rated\n• TURN KEY condition\n• Converted garage providing additional bedroom accommodation\n• Private bathroom to converted garage room\n• Extra-large south-facing rear garden\n• Low-maintenance rear garden\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Quiet cul-de-sac location\n• Excellent potential\n• Close to schools, shops and local amenities\n• Easy access to the N3 & M50 motorway networks\n• Ideal family home\n• Early viewing strongly advised</li>\n</ul>"
      },
